<title>THAILAND: Thai stock markets close May 20 for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai stock markets close May 20 for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's stock market was closed on Tuesday for the Buddhist Visakha Pucha Day, a stock exchange official said.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on May 21, she said.</p>
<p>Thai stocks closed up 2.84 percent higher on Monday at 577.10 on 4.09 billion baht turnover.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
